text gText_DiancieSpeech_HearFeelLove
{
	"Hear…{PAUSE 180}{PAUSE 90} Feel…{PAUSE 180}{PAUSE 90} Love…\p"
	"I can feel your heart beating true…\nCould you be the one I seek?\p"
}

text gText_DiancieSpeech_CantSeeYou
{
	"While I can hear your heart yet,\nI have trouble seeing you in full.\p"
}

text gText_DiancieSpeech_DiancieAsksYourGenderPresentation
{
	"How do you present?"
}

text gText_DiancieSpeech_YouLookWonderful
{
	"Is that so? What a wonderful visage you\nbless the world with…\p"
	"Then… what are you called?\p"
}

text gText_DiancieSpeech_WhatABeautifulName1
{
	"What a beautfiul name…!\p{STR_VAR_1}\p"
}

text gText_DiancieSpeech_PleaseComeHither
{
	"Yes… I feel it to be true. You are the\none I've been searching for.\p"
	"Please! I implore you to come hither…\p"
}